msgctxt "80"
msgid "What's so bad about grammar, Shiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "I dunno, there aren't any rules! Math's way better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Math!? Ewww!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "C'mon, math's fun! It's like solving a puzzle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "But solving puzzles is fun..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Hey, are you two all clean and shiny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Yup! I took my bath a little while ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Me too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Good. And how's your homework coming along?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "All finished!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I'm mostly done... but I still have grammar to do. I'm so bad at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "All the more reason to do your homework and study, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I mean, yeah... but I just don't get how it even works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"That's okay. If you always avoid things that are difficult, you'll never be "
"able to grow. Owning up to your weaknesses and facing them head-on is the "
"best way to improve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Okay. I'll try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"And hey, studying can be pretty fun once you get the hang of it. Why don't "
"you ask Ayako to give you a hand? I'm sure she'd be more than glad to help "
"you out."
msgstr ""

